WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:02.850
Hey, what should we play?

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.790
Let's jump rope.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:08.330
If we don't get to the ground quick,
the White Cats will get us.

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:09.790
Yeah, let's go.

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:12.740
Let's go eat anmitsu together today.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.800
-You want some more?
-This kid.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.120
Don't bother with Inuzuka.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:21.620
Like I'd ever be friends with you.

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:24.750
I don't need any friends.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.560
Inuzuka's a little scary.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:30.730
Yeah, he is.

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:07.820
I was watching you with my hidden feelings from afar

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:16.670
As you lit up with a thousand lights, I felt the wind blowing at that moment

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:22.670
I expressed all of my feelings to you

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:28.010
I heard my heart beating, I can't look away

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:33.180
I decided to become strong enough to change the world

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:36.940
So that I can protect you

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:42.440
Beyond the dazzling times, we will have a miraculous encounter

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:47.990
Which will ensure that we get closer despite our limitless dreams

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:53.040
but know that we will courageously overcome this obstacle that faces us

00:01:53.200 --> 00:02:00.000
Don't forget that we are united by a force of determination that no one knows.

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:07.270
Romio and Hasuki

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:21.240
The day has come again.

00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:24.910
Alrighty!

00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:29.790
Okay, maggots, the day of all-out war
with the White Cats draws near.

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:34.390
We're betting our pride that we'll
come out on top in the midterm tests.

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:35.800
Yeah!

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:37.980
Those White Cats are gonna get factored!

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:39.770
I am a pen!

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:43.450
This time you'll have to take me seriously!

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:48.810
Inuzuka. I came because
you said I had to, but what is this?

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:51.450
The traditional Black Doggy study camp.

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:53.040
Three days before our tests.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:56.420
A 72 hour intense study-until-you-drop session.

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:58.570
Is there a point to me being here for it?

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:03.050
We can't leave the dorm at all during the camp.

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:06.330
You called me here because
you couldn't see me for three days?

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:09.710
-You need to be able to put up with that, Girly-zuka.
-Girly-zuka?

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:12.630
We're doing the training camp again this year, huh?

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:14.770
Maru, should we get involved too?

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:16.100
It's idiotic.

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:18.630
No point in being all buddy-buddy.

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:22.890
It's that brat who threw Maru down!

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:24.890
What are you gonna do, Maru?

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:28.410
-Maru?
-What's the problem?

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:30.480
Am I not allowed to study?

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:32.770
Your idiocy will spread like a disease.

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:35.770
Rich coming from the guy
who's borderline failing every year.

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:37.580
Come on, we're studying, right?

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:39.710
Fight! Fight! Fight!

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:42.410
-What about studying?
-Shut up!

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:45.800
You brainless pigs are only good at squealing.

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:49.540
The next one that cries without permission
will be roasted for dinner.

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:52.430
-Yes!
-You respond with, "Yes, ma'am!"

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:55.890
-Yes, ma'am!
-I can't hear you! Where's your balls?

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:57.130
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:00.650
-Who's that?
-It's Hasuki.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:01.880
Wasn't she more...?

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:06.910
-What was that for?
-I said no speaking without permission.

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:09.280
Aren't you in middle school, anyway?

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:10.820
Why are you here?

00:04:10.820 --> 00:04:13.660
His academics are on par with high schoolers,

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:16.480
-so he wanted to take part--
-I didn't ask you.

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:18.710
I suppose it's fine.

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:21.250
Our training camp doesn't turn anyone away.

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:24.040
Struggle to the utmost, you maggots.

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:25.990
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:30.300
That startled me.
She's like a completely different person.

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:33.680
Hasuki's personality changes when she puts glasses on.

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:37.520
And despite her looks,
she's top doggy in her class.

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:42.630
At every test training camp,
she takes charge of everyone at risk of failing.

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:47.230
Now, to test your current academic prowess,
we'll be taking a small test.

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:48.740
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:50.350
Begin!

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:53.850
All right, now I can show off to Persia. Question one.

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:55.980
He fell asleep fast.

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:58.570
-Wake up!
-What is that?

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:02.170
If you sleep, you get clipped
with specially made clips as a penalty.

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:03.580
I see.

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:05.820
But, I'm still getting sleepy--

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:09.170
What an idiot.

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:11.950
Tests are all about how well you can cheat.

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:15.550
Cellphones are prohibited during the tests.

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:17.210
Just avoid getting caught.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:19.730
I really don't like that kind of stuff.

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:23.210
It's cooler if a man fights it out fair and square
with everything he's got.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:26.730
Hey, Maru.
Let's beat this kid up, after all.

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:29.570
Maru, why are you doing as he says?

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:31.450
What? Yeah, right.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:33.850
I've been sick of cellphones for a while anyway.

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:36.600
-Hey, Kohitsuji. Maru's acting weird.
-It's finished.

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:40.360
-Boobs!
-You-- Those

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:41.750
are boobs!

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:43.860
What? Boobs?

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:45.820
Panties.

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:48.550
You'd better get serious.

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:49.950
Yes, ma'am.

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:54.290
-This is how you factor an equation.
-That's unexpected.

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:59.140
You seem to hate studying,
yet you haven't complained once.

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:00.640
Yeah.

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:02.430
This school has prestige.

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:05.550
If I fail, I'll be sent right back to my country.

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:10.570
Hasuki is giving her all
to make sure that doesn't happen to any of us.

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:13.810
She loves every one of us Black Doggies.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:16.560
Everyone is grateful for that.

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:18.560
Since many of you missed this question...

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:21.580
-You two! Are you listening?
-Yeah!

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:23.080
Then repeat it back to me!

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:25.570
-We weren't listening!
-You fools!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:31.460
Sorry about today.

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:33.010
You'd better be.

00:06:33.010 --> 00:06:36.640
Well, the White Cats don't really study together,

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:38.650
so it was kind of fun.

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:40.920
We won't be able to meet until after the tests.

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.790
I-- I know that.

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:47.360
It's not like I won't be lonely too.

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:51.360
-Well, good luck on your tests.
-What was that just now?

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:53.530
What a bashful girl.

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:55.060
Inuzuka.

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:57.310
Hasuki?

00:06:57.870 --> 00:07:00.870
-Why are you so surprised?
-I-I'm not.

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:03.410
You just disappeared, so I went looking.

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:06.750
-I haven't left the dorm grounds.
-I know.

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:08.590
Then all is well.

00:07:09.590 --> 00:07:12.590
Anyway, today's lesson was pretty easy to grasp.

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:14.450
Thanks to you, I'll be able to pass.

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:16.140
Thanks.

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:18.140
I'm glad.

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:20.760
Your usual smile is back.

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:22.060
What do you mean?

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:23.920
It's just...

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:29.810
Well, like the thing with Char before,
recently you've done things that I don't understand.

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:33.720
I thought you might be keeping secrets from me.

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:36.780
Of course not.

00:07:36.780 --> 00:07:40.230
-This is us we're talking about.
-Good.

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:42.790
I'll always be your ally.

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:44.860
If you ever need anything, just ask.

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:49.240
-I will.
-See you, Inuzuka.

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:57.840
What are you lost in thought about?

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:00.120
Char, why are you here?

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:02.100
You.

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:05.140
Sneaking your lover into
the Black Doggy den disguised as a boy?

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:07.230
What kind of fetish do you have?

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:09.560
You pervy dog.

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:14.690
Next time you do something like this,
I'll make you bungee jump from the roof with no rope.

00:08:14.690 --> 00:08:15.940
I'm sorry.

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.780
It was rather reckless.

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:19.740
Wait, were you watching us?

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:22.020
Does that really matter?

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:24.990
More importantly,

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:27.750
you've got quite the nerve.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:32.620
You've got Per,
and you're still running around with another girl.

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:34.420
You mean Hasuki?

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:36.910
It's not like that, she's a friend.

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:40.260
Be careful she doesn't find out about Per.

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:43.790
Do you know what would happen if rumors started?

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.330
Hasuki isn't someone who'd start rumors.

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:47.770
You seem pretty sure.

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:50.940
I've known her since elementary school.
I trust her more than anyone.

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:52.230
So you say.

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:56.980
But haven't you been hiding things
from her because you couldn't trust her?

00:08:56.980 --> 00:09:00.220
That's not--
Everyone has things they keep secret.

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:03.310
You're angry. Bye now!

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:07.720
That jerk, just mouthing off as she pleases.

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:11.230
Of course I want to tell Hasuki the truth.

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:13.290
But if I did,

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:15.700
she loves the Black Doggies,

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:18.800
so there's no way we could stay friends.

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:22.750
What should I do?

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:34.760
What are you smiling for all on your own? It's creepy.

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:37.390
-Maru.
-Everyone's asleep.

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:39.820
Then what are you doing still up?

00:09:39.820 --> 00:09:41.610
I was hungry.

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:44.890
Did you steal those from the kitchen,
you little thief?

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:48.990
Shut up. Now you're an accomplice.

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:51.830
Are you making the quiz for tomorrow?

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:53.420
That's dedication.

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:56.790
I don't mind when it's for the Black Doggies' sake.

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:59.280
It's not for us, but Inuzuka. Am I wrong?

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:04.340
Why would you think that?

00:10:04.340 --> 00:10:07.100
Did you really think we were clueless?

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:09.940
What's so great about that guy anyway?

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:16.880
When I was a kid, I wasn't good at talking with people
and being around them.

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:19.780
I had good grades, at least.

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:24.450
I couldn't make any friends,
so I just studied all the time.

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:26.820
But...

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:28.520
I don't get this at all.

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:31.270
If you just subtract there...

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:36.420
I'm sorry. You looked so lost

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:38.030
I just-- I...

00:10:38.540 --> 00:10:40.030
Are you a genius?

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:45.750
What about this one? This one?

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:47.870
This one?

00:10:49.430 --> 00:10:51.750
I've never gotten a grade like this!

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:53.640
It's all thanks to Susuki.

00:10:53.640 --> 00:10:56.730
Thanks a lot! Let's be friends!

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:03.900
Okay. And my name's Hasuki.

00:11:03.900 --> 00:11:05.700
Oh, sorry, Susuki.

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:06.950
Teach me too!

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:09.270
Those words from Inuzuka were my turning point.

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:12.180
I was able to change.

00:11:12.180 --> 00:11:16.530
That's why I want to be at least a little useful to him.

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:21.530
I want to be able to stand by his side
and walk the same path.

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:27.410
That's why you organize this whole camp
every time? That's creepy.

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:30.470
You couldn't understand the heart of a maiden.

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:33.390
Oh, be quiet. I'm going to sleep.

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:42.550
What now, Maru? You still--

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:47.310
Inuzuka. You're still awake?

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:51.940
You heard?

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:57.690
-Yeah.
-Oh, how embarrassing.

00:11:58.420 --> 00:12:00.700
Why would you go so far for me?

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:05.380
It's obvious.

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:09.890
It's because...

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:11.330
I love you.

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:14.850
Hasuki...

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:16.900
The first friend I ever made.

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:21.970
I can't hide things from Hasuki anymore,
not with the way she feels.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:25.330
I said it, I said it...

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:26.720
Hasuki.

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:30.610
I'll tell you everything, so hear me out.

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:39.080
I'll tell you everything, so hear me out.

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:40.990
I've never told anyone.

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:44.000
Persia and I are dating.

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:47.990
So hearing how you feel makes me happy,
but I can't reciprocate.

00:12:48.270 --> 00:12:49.800
Also...

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:52.370
I'm sorry for not telling you until now.

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:56.520
You're kidding, right?

00:12:56.520 --> 00:12:59.230
Is this like with Char,
when she blackmailed you?

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:00.400
No.

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:02.980
It's of my own free will.

00:13:04.270 --> 00:13:06.140
I see.

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:11.470
Everyone! Listen up!

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:13.120
Inuzuka and Persia--

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:16.020
Wait, wait, wait!
Calm down, let's talk about this.

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:23.460
You're right.

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:25.780
I was just surprised
hearing that all of a sudden.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:27.250
That was close.

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:30.220
I didn't think she'd immediately try to out me.

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:33.180
She's been with me since we were kids.

00:13:33.180 --> 00:13:35.720
I thought she'd understand if I told her--

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:40.800
-Hey.
-We're friends, aren't we?

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:43.920
Of course. That's why I told you my secret.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:47.800
It's not like I'd betray the Black Doggies.

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:52.030
What's this?

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:53.810
Do you see that?

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:56.780
It's the Black Doggy code that we all agreed on.

00:13:56.780 --> 00:14:00.190
If we jump ship or fall in love with a White Cat...

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:01.940
it's seppuku.

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:07.450
Well, I'd thought that before, but this
"falling in love" part seems a little biased.

00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:11.150
What are you planning to do
with the Touwa sword?

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:12.450
You can't be serious.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:15.320
Hasuki is sad about it too.

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:17.210
But the code is the code.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:21.930
As your former friend, I will show mercy and behead you
to hasten your death once you've begun seppuku.

00:14:21.930 --> 00:14:24.940
Wait, wait, wait! That's a replica, right?
It's a joke, right?

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:28.470
Why do the girls at this school always
go straight for the swords?

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:30.320
This isn't like you.

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:32.780
You wouldn't do something like this.

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:34.100
The Hasuki I know--

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:35.950
The Hasuki you know?

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:38.140
Hasuki is Hasuki.

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:43.120
Thinking, "Hasuki can keep a secret,
she'll understand if I tell her,"

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:45.740
was wishful thinking on your part.

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:51.140
Hasuki will not allow you to go on
deceiving the Black Doggies.

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:54.870
Inuzuka will be purged by Hasuki's hands.

00:14:57.470 --> 00:15:00.010
Was I prepared to hear
that we couldn't be friends?

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:01.250
I was naive.

00:15:01.490 --> 00:15:04.880
I didn't think she'd hate me this much.

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:08.090
Is this what our relationship
amounts to?

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:12.280
-Wait! I'll open your eyes!
-What's all the ruckus?

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:14.610
You're keeping me up.

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:16.570
-Move it!
-Inuzuka?

00:15:16.570 --> 00:15:18.660
What's got you looking so grim?

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:20.950
It's Hasuki.

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:22.360
This is the guys' hall.

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:27.840
You're not getting away.

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:32.070
Damn, what's all the noise?

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:38.550
What's wrong, Maru?

00:15:38.550 --> 00:15:41.330
Why'd you lock the door?
We can't get in!

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:45.020
Hey, did you hear that weird sound
over by the Black Doggies?

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:48.540
-Weird sound?
-It sounded like glass breaking--

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:50.220
Hold it!

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:51.860
What is it?

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:53.340
Nothing.

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:55.970
What is that idiot doing?

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:59.280
Where'd that Inuzuka go?

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:02.250
Don't think you can flee into the hills.

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:05.750
What am I supposed to do now?

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:07.360
She's back.

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:10.650
Inuzuka!

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:12.340
What happened?

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:13.780
Persia?

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:17.490
What? You told Hasuki about our relationship?

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:19.250
You're too loud.

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:22.220
Sorry for doing that without asking,

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:25.560
but I wanted to respond to her feelings honestly.

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:30.650
So why does answering her honestly
lead to being chased around with a sword?

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:34.140
You could call that a miscalculation,
or a hopeful presumption.

00:16:34.900 --> 00:16:37.570
But I promise to work this out.

00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:39.890
I won't let her hurt you.

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:43.240
Don't worry about me.

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:45.750
What do you want to do?

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:47.940
I...

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:50.940
So the two of you really are dating.

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:54.570
Wait, Hasuki.
It might be selfish, but hear me out.

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:57.080
I don't have ears to listen to you.

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:05.640
Now you're flirting in front of Hasuki?

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:07.960
That's some nerve.

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:10.640
-Hey!
-This is a good opportunity.

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:14.260
-I'll settle things here, Persia.
-Oh, no!

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:16.550
I disapprove.

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:20.770
-Hey!
-Char?

00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:23.520
-Let go.
-What are you doing here?

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:25.660
Sorry, Per.

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:28.900
The truth is, I knew about your relationship.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:30.650
So you'd allow it then?

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:33.080
Don't be silly.

00:17:33.080 --> 00:17:38.000
I'm simply watching over Per
to keep her out of danger.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.280
As her friend.

00:17:40.090 --> 00:17:44.660
Plus, there's another reason I've come here.

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:47.350
To kill Inuzuka.

00:17:47.350 --> 00:17:50.170
I'd warned him about that.

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:52.550
It never ends. Crap!

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:54.100
Hey, let me down!

00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:55.480
Tactical retreat!

00:17:55.480 --> 00:17:57.300
-Hold it, Inuzuka!
-Hold it, Inuzuka!

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:01.310
I had no idea...

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:04.060
Char knew about us.

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:08.900
Maybe she wanted to hear it from me.

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:18.550
What is it?

00:18:18.550 --> 00:18:20.780
I'm so worthless.

00:18:21.260 --> 00:18:24.590
Talking big like I could change this world.

00:18:24.590 --> 00:18:28.030
The reality is that I can't even convince one friend.

00:18:28.030 --> 00:18:31.290
I put Persia in danger.

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:32.800
I'm such a loser.

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:36.940
I'm the one who...

00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:39.300
Let me down.

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:42.310
-Is your foot okay?
-I just twisted it a little.

00:18:44.950 --> 00:18:47.520
Let's face them, no running away.

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:50.360
Don't say you're worthless.

00:18:50.360 --> 00:18:52.910
I know you can change anything.

00:18:52.910 --> 00:18:54.610
Don't you remember?

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:57.990
You're the one who changed my heart that day.

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:05.500
Have you accepted your fate?

00:19:06.800 --> 00:19:08.870
Yeah. I've accepted it.

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:12.500
I shall abide by Black Doggy code
and deliver punishment.

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:16.020
Good. I'll take all you can dish out.

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:17.600
I'm done running.

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:20.260
Though, you know I'm selfish.

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:24.260
No matter how much you hate me,
or label me a traitor,

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:25.890
I'll keep

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:30.120
wanting to be your friend,

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:32.580
from the bottom of my heart.

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:35.320
Let's be friends.

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:46.830
So it was a replica after all.

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:49.560
Shut up.

00:19:50.090 --> 00:19:52.010
Hasuki...

00:19:52.010 --> 00:19:54.210
hates you, Inuzuka.

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:00.070
Persia!

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:04.430
Persia!

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:06.140
-Inuzuka!
-Per!

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:10.390
Oh, crap. I can't swim.

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:19.280
Inuzuka! Inuzuka!

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:25.030
Hasuki?

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:27.090
That's right.

00:20:27.090 --> 00:20:29.940
I was drowning.

00:20:29.940 --> 00:20:33.270
-Where's Persia?
-Char saved her.

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:36.250
I'm just a damsel in distress today.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:38.520
Thank goodness.

00:20:38.520 --> 00:20:41.190
Then, you saved me, Hasuki?

00:20:41.190 --> 00:20:43.020
-Thanks.
-Dumbass!

00:20:43.020 --> 00:20:47.020
Inuzuka, you can't swim. Why did you jump in?

00:20:47.020 --> 00:20:48.630
Why?

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:52.190
I thought Persia was in danger.
Before I knew it, I'd jumped.

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:54.580
There wasn't a reason.

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:57.700
I see.

00:20:57.700 --> 00:21:02.630
You see her the same way I see you...

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:12.260
Inuzuka you stupid idiot!

00:21:12.260 --> 00:21:16.460
You're our leader.
How could you be ensnared by Persia?

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.980
You traitor! You dummy!

00:21:18.980 --> 00:21:21.390
You show-off! You closet pervert!

00:21:21.390 --> 00:21:23.190
Hey!

00:21:23.190 --> 00:21:27.100
Telling your friends convenient lies.

00:21:27.100 --> 00:21:29.970
We can't just go on like nothing's changed.

00:21:30.650 --> 00:21:35.850
-I hate you.
-I know.

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:38.580
I really hate you.

00:21:40.330 --> 00:21:42.000
I know.

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:52.890
Good morning.

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:56.570
-Morning, Inuzuka.
-Yeah.

00:21:56.570 --> 00:21:58.540
-What is it?
-Nothing.

00:21:59.060 --> 00:22:01.190
Breakfast time.

00:22:02.310 --> 00:22:05.440
It looks like Hasuki didn't spill the beans.

00:22:05.440 --> 00:22:07.900
But how do I face her?

00:22:07.900 --> 00:22:09.680
What are you spacing out for?

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:11.430
What? Hasuki!

00:22:13.700 --> 00:22:16.690
The training camp isn't over yet.
Stay in form.

00:22:19.560 --> 00:22:21.660
What's that dumb face for?

00:22:21.660 --> 00:22:24.410
You're the one who said you wanted to stay friends.

00:22:24.410 --> 00:22:26.130
Let's go already.

00:22:29.750 --> 00:22:30.990
Right.

00:22:30.990 --> 00:22:33.550
And don't think I'm overlooking this.

00:22:33.550 --> 00:22:37.970
If you get flirty in front of Hasuki,
I'll put you on the chopping block.

00:22:37.970 --> 00:22:40.140
Yes, ma'am.

00:22:42.020 --> 00:22:48.860
Just running and running, so awkward and clumsy

00:22:49.030 --> 00:22:56.870
My passion is so intense that my heart yearns

00:22:57.040 --> 00:23:04.170
Your eyes so honest and earnest

00:23:04.330 --> 00:23:10.800
I want to match the love you have for me

00:23:11.970 --> 00:23:19.020
You don't wait for your dreams to come true, you sprint onward

00:23:19.180 --> 00:23:25.360
Pulling me by the hand when I had given up

00:23:25.520 --> 00:23:32.610
Your dream suddenly became my dream

00:23:32.780 --> 00:23:34.820
I want to support you

00:23:34.990 --> 00:23:42.660
With everything I have

00:23:42.830 --> 00:23:50.760
Until the world can one day change

00:23:52.750 --> 00:23:56.200
-Did you guys have fun this week too?
-Yes, ma'am!

00:23:56.200 --> 00:23:59.210
-We'll have another session when the test is near.
-Yes, ma'am!

00:23:59.210 --> 00:24:00.580
-Did you bathe?
-Yes, ma'am!

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:02.460
-Brush your teeth?
-Yes, ma'am!

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:02.640
Romio and the Sports Festival
-Brush your teeth?
-Yes, ma'am!

00:24:02.640 --> 00:24:05.340
Next, Romio and the Sports Festival.
You'd better watch it.
Romio and the Sports Festival

00:24:05.340 --> 00:24:06.960
Yes, ma'am!
Romio and the Sports Festival
